            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.6.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>Codex: usage from Codex CLI 0.153+ is counted again. Newer rollouts log each response as a <code>token_usage_record</code> line and no longer emit the <code>token_count</code> event Runic read, so sessions on gpt-6-astra (and recent gpt-5.6 sessions) showed no tokens, no model, and no cost. Existing installs run a one-time full rescan on the next refresh to recover the missed history.</li>
<li>Codex: pricing and context windows for gpt-5.6 Sol / Terra / Luna and gpt-6-astra (272K context per Codex's own model cache); the Codex card's fallback context label now says GPT-6 Astra.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
